# The employee is late: the reminder is sent once, recording stays possible.
start
wait P14D
expect open RecordHours, SendReminder, SubmissionDeadline
complete SendReminder
# another two weeks later nothing happens, the reminder was a one-off
wait P14D
expect open RecordHours, SubmissionDeadline
complete RecordHours
complete SubmitTimesheet
complete CheckWorkingTime hasViolations=false
complete RegisterSubmission
complete AnnounceSubmission
complete Review correct=true
complete Release
expect status COMPLETED
